# Quality Verification

Quality verification using state-operator mappings. Verify through operator sequences, not static checklists.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Completing tasks or marking work as done
- Verifying code quality
- Ensuring correctness
- Finalizing work

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable verification rules.

